## drain: remove a backend from the pool that carries 20 WebSocket connections (drain 3s)
starting config:
     1	global
     2	  admin admin.sock
     3	  state state
     4	  trace-log off
     5	
     6	site http://plain.test:45877
     7	  route /ws -> ws
     8	
     9	pool ws
    10	  backend 127.0.0.1:60773
    11	  backend 127.0.0.1:35405
    12	  health /healthz every 1s
    13	  drain 3s
